### ADMIN operator only. Set host/accessToken/fromDate/toDate using the approved environment.
### Login through auth.http; never store a real bearer token in this file.
### Report profile/gates must be approved separately; these requests do not activate them.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Preview whole-scope local evidence; optional departmentId must come from the real workflow.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/outpatient/coverage/preview?fromDate={{fromDate}}&toDate={{toDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Approve only after reviewing all five source-owner proofs.
### coverageAcceptanceBody is the complete reviewed JSON from the Report operator runbook:
### ../report-service/operations/outpatient-coverage-acceptance.md
### Keep the identical body/requestId/actor on an ambiguous retry. No automatic approval.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reports/outpatient/coverage/acceptances
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{{coverageAcceptanceBody}}
